(7067942, 1075254, 96751, '<td valign="top">After the riot of color before this image, I feel like I''ve entered a sanctuary! A beautiful image which will likely not do as well as it would in another challenge.</td>', 'After the riot of color before this image, I feel like I''ve entered a sanctuary! A beautiful image which will likely not do as well as it would in another challenge.', '2013-07-12 02:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
