(7068353, 1075300, 112828, '<td valign="top">Really really really nice.<br/> <br/>Can''t say enough about how well I like this image.<br/> <br/>I think maybe you moved that leaf into the composition? (is that a banana leaf?)  Looks really good there.<br/> <br/>The composition is really the strength of this image, and is what makes it work so well.<br/> <br/>Of course, the inclusion of the word Felice is just a super bonus.  If this doesn''t make it to the top ten I''ll be shocked.</td>', 'Really really really nice. Can''t say enough about how well I like this image. I think maybe you moved that leaf into the composition? (is that a banana leaf?)  Looks really good there. The composition is really the strength of this image, and is what makes it work so well. Of course, the inclusion of the word Felice is just a super bonus.  If this doesn''t make it to the top ten I''ll be shocked.', '2013-07-12 15:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7068355, 1075002, 112828, '<td valign="top">If only that man weren''t in the image.<br/> <br/>It''s certainly true to Angus''s style, so I can''t really penalize you - but I would have certainly liked the image better sans the man - that painted square with rust stains is just... AMAZING.</td>', 'If only that man weren''t in the image. It''s certainly true to Angus''s style, so I can''t really penalize you - but I would have certainly liked the image better sans the man - that painted square with rust stains is just... AMAZING.', '2013-07-12 15:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7068356, 1075037, 112828, '<td valign="top">Love it!!  Very true to his style, other than I think a vertical shift would have helped a little, the sign being centered is a little awkward.  Still, and easy 7.</td>', 'Love it!!  Very true to his style, other than I think a vertical shift would have helped a little, the sign being centered is a little awkward.  Still, and easy 7.', '2013-07-12 16:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
