(7068365, 1075227, 112828, '<td valign="top">Very nice - weathered and crusty.<br/> <br/>If you had done some selective coloration on the stucco I think this might have gone for a ribbon.  As it is, it''s a little too gray, but still I like it greatly.</td>', 'Very nice - weathered and crusty. If you had done some selective coloration on the stucco I think this might have gone for a ribbon.  As it is, it''s a little too gray, but still I like it greatly.', '2013-07-12 16:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7068366, 1075254, 90414, '<td valign="top">I really like this image. I don''t think it necessarily meets the challenge as far as "McDonald''s New Happiness," but photographically, is one of the best photos. So congrats on a successful shoehorn.</td>', 'I really like this image. I don''t think it necessarily meets the challenge as far as "McDonald''s New Happiness," but photographically, is one of the best photos. So congrats on a successful shoehorn.', '2013-07-12 16:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7068368, 1075196, 112828, '<td valign="top">Angus didn''t use shadows.<br/> <br/>You did.<br/> <br/>And it worked. :)<br/> <br/>Mostly I didn''t like the images in the challenge that were taken in very hard light - but you made this work like a champ.  Well done, and VERY happy.  The palate of red, white, and black is also very powerful, and reminiscent of one of his more powerful shots.<br/> <br/>I do, however, think the inclusion of the tree shadow was a very sad mistake, as it ruined the pure geometric feel of this image, and distracts me while viewing it.<br/> <br/>Seriously this could have been an 8 or a 9 easy with a different crop.</td>', 'Angus didn''t use shadows. You did. And it worked. :) Mostly I didn''t like the images in the challenge that were taken in very hard light - but you made this work like a champ.  Well done, and VERY happy.  The palate of red, white, and black is also very powerful, and reminiscent of one of his more powerful shots. I do, however, think the inclusion of the tree shadow was a very sad mistake, as it ruined the pure geometric feel of this image, and distracts me while viewing it. Seriously this could have been an 8 or a 9 easy with a different crop.', '2013-07-12 16:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7068369, 1075291, 112828, '<td valign="top">I like it, but the ground would have been better cropped out.</td>', 'I like it, but the ground would have been better cropped out.', '2013-07-12 16:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7068370, 1074782, 112828, '<td valign="top">I like it.  The slight asymmetry is really awesome here.</td>', 'I like it.  The slight asymmetry is really awesome here.', '2013-07-12 16:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7068371, 1075364, 112828, '<td valign="top">And two pounds of happiness!  Lovely image.</td>', 'And two pounds of happiness!  Lovely image.', '2013-07-12 16:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7068372, 1074734, 112828, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the processing on this image, but I do think it''s really an image that is true to the challenge, so I''ll have to score it reasonably high.</td>', 'I don''t care for the processing on this image, but I do think it''s really an image that is true to the challenge, so I''ll have to score it reasonably high.', '2013-07-12 16:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7068373, 1075278, 112828, '<td valign="top">Oh no!~!<br/> <br/>This is a FANTASTIC IMAGE.  But.. You have a horrible skew that just absolutely destroys the power of the image. :( <br/> <br/>I feel both happy and sad when viewing this - it''s a great shot, but it really could have made it to the front page if you had fixed that skew. :) :(</td>', 'Oh no!~! This is a FANTASTIC IMAGE.  But.. You have a horrible skew that just absolutely destroys the power of the image. :(  I feel both happy and sad when viewing this - it''s a great shot, but it really could have made it to the front page if you had fixed that skew. :) :(', '2013-07-12 16:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7068374, 1074960, 112828, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Love the color combo here</td>', 'Very nice.  Love the color combo here', '2013-07-12 16:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7068376, 1075223, 112828, '<td valign="top">There is some really strange coloration (color noise I think) in the wood.<br/> <br/>Such a hard image to score - it meets the challenge very well.  Has just the right feel, and is a well shot and chosen subject.<br/> <br/>The processing lets me down a little here though.  Surely a 6 is fair, but I could so easily have been persuaded to 7 or 8 with different processing.</td>', 'There is some really strange coloration (color noise I think) in the wood. Such a hard image to score - it meets the challenge very well.  Has just the right feel, and is a well shot and chosen subject. The processing lets me down a little here though.  Surely a 6 is fair, but I could so easily have been persuaded to 7 or 8 with different processing.', '2013-07-12 16:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7068377, 1075315, 112828, '<td valign="top">Skewed, and not as sharp as I would prefer.<br/> <br/>Still, really quite nice, and with just the right feel!</td>', 'Skewed, and not as sharp as I would prefer. Still, really quite nice, and with just the right feel!', '2013-07-12 16:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
