(7068810, 1075181, 100975, '<td valign="top">Overall I like the color and composition of this image.  It appears that symmetry was part of your image capture, so if I may, I see two things that I would have tried to fix by moving the (skis?(Endless Summer surfboards like the movie?).  One, the middle ski could have been shifted to the right a little.  Two, the one on the right seems to be just a little higher than the one on the left and definitely higher than the one in the middle.  Would have been a little better if they were all the same height or maybe just the outer two were the same height, or maybe even stair stepped.  I would like to have seen them all the same height myself.</td>', 'Overall I like the color and composition of this image.  It appears that symmetry was part of your image capture, so if I may, I see two things that I would have tried to fix by moving the (skis?(Endless Summer surfboards like the movie?).  One, the middle ski could have been shifted to the right a little.  Two, the one on the right seems to be just a little higher than the one on the left and definitely higher than the one in the middle.  Would have been a little better if they were all the same height or maybe just the outer two were the same height, or maybe even stair stepped.  I would like to have seen them all the same height myself.', '2013-07-13 00:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7068978, 1075358, 112828, '<td valign="top">Interesting geometry.<br/> <br/>What I really like is how the shadows diverge from each other, and the grasses don''t cast shadows on the wall.<br/> <br/>Really a rather nice image, even if it''s not quite as ''happy'' as I expected in this challenge.</td>', 'Interesting geometry. What I really like is how the shadows diverge from each other, and the grasses don''t cast shadows on the wall. Really a rather nice image, even if it''s not quite as ''happy'' as I expected in this challenge.', '2013-07-13 03:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
