(7071611, 1075302, 147314, '<td valign="top">Except for the contrasting (white, green and blue) colours, I''m not sure this is Angus''s style.</td>', 'Except for the contrasting (white, green and blue) colours, I''m not sure this is Angus''s style.', '2013-07-16 17:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
