(7073682, 1074879, 100831, '<td valign="top">"Prepare for Marshmallow Gap"<br/> <br/>Okay, that was my original comment (?) and I have NO IDEA what I was talking about.<br/>However, I do see sticky marshmallows on that wall on the left.. and a funny face about to eat one...<br/> <br/>I actually came back to this image several times during the course of the week as I find it fascinating. The shadow, the peeling paint, the colors that were once bright. Altogether sweet and I like it!! For me it very much conveys the New Happiness theme. Good one. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-07-19 13:01:00.</i></td>', '"Prepare for Marshmallow Gap" Okay, that was my original comment (?) and I have NO IDEA what I was talking about.However, I do see sticky marshmallows on that wall on the left.. and a funny face about to eat one... I actually came back to this image several times during the course of the week as I find it fascinating. The shadow, the peeling paint, the colors that were once bright. Altogether sweet and I like it!! For me it very much conveys the New Happiness theme. Good one. ', '2013-07-19 00:23:12.000000', '2013-07-19 14:01:00.000000', 1),
